   <media:title>A New Take on Hybrid Performance | Lotus Eletre X</media:title>
   <media:content url="https://www.youtube.com/v/fQcS6dY47RE?version=3" type="application/x-shockwave-flash" width="640" height="390"/>
   <media:thumbnail url="https://i3.ytimg.com/vi/fQcS6dY47RE/hqdefault.jpg" width="480" height="360"/>
   <media:description>The Lotus Eletre X, the next-generation performance hybrid SUV that combines electric driving with intelligent onboard power generation.

Powered by Lotus X-Hybrid technology, Eletre X delivers up to 952 PS, accelerates from 0–100 km/h in 3.3 seconds and offers up to 1,200 km of combined range.

Explore the details behind the Eletre X, from its advanced 900V architecture and 70 kWh battery to its distinctive design, intelligent hybrid powertrain and performance-focused engineering.

Key specs:

- Up to 952 PS
- 0–100 km/h in 3.3 seconds
- Up to 305 km pure electric range
- Up to 1,200 km combined range
- 900V electrical architecture
- 150 kW onboard power generator

Discover more about Eletre X at:

www.lotuscars.com</media:description>
