   <media:description>One powertrain. Different ways to drive.

More electric driving every day. More range for the longer journeys. And Lotus performance always available. 

So, how does the Lotus Eletre X actually work? 

The new X Hybrid drivetrain combines electric performance with a high-performance hybrid powertrain.

- Up to 952 PS,
- 0–100 km/h (0–62 mph) in 3.3 seconds, 
- Up to 350 km (217 miles) of electric-only range 
- Over 1,200 km (745 miles) combined.

In 60 seconds, we break down the powertrain and the drive modes

For more information visit:

www.lotuscars.com/eletre-x</media:description>
