   <media:thumbnail url="https://i3.ytimg.com/vi/zzzb4qg7v2M/hqdefault.jpg" width="480" height="360"/>
   <media:description>Go behind the scenes of the design that defines the future of Lotus.

A look inside the two-year journey to create Theory 1 - our first concept car built on the Digital, Natural, Analogue design philosophy. A radical reimagining of what performance cars can be.

Watch as the Lotus design team and partners pushed boundaries to achieve the impossible: a sub-1,600kg electric hypercar delivering 986hp, engineered with just ten core surface materials. From the recycled carbon tub to the patent-pending door system, witness the challenges, breakthroughs, and obsessive attention to detail that brought Theory 1 to life.

For more visit:  www.lotuscars.com/Theory1</media:description>
